  "description": "Debug your life with these classic developer sounds",
  "story": [
    "Coding is 10% writing code and 90% debugging why it doesn't work. 😅",
    "We built the \"Developer's Pain\" soundboard specifically for that 90%.",
    "When production breaks, the deployment fails, or that dreaded Slack notification hits, don't just internalize the stress. Smash the \"Windows XP Error\" key instead.",
    "It’s open-source, keyboard-friendly, and serves as instant audio therapy for engineers. Give it a try during your next incident review!"
